WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,350
Jian Tong

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,780
You're not in love, are you?

3
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:15,040
What did you want her to be but I didn't say it?

4
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:21,300
Meals on the cabinet

5
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:23,020
I specially asked Bai Yexing to buy it.

6
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:26,010
Bi Xing is so funny that he just did that

7
00:00:26,410 --> 00:00:27,410
I have to give you the benefits too

8
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,640
These are the company's reimbursements for your hospitalization

9
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,280
If it’s not enough, go tell Su Meng

10
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:33,620
Take good care of your illness and take good care of your health

11
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:34,980
Only then can I make money

12
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:44,450
I was stupid

13
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:47,330
Jian Tong is in the same dormitory as you and she is sick.

14
00:00:47,570 --> 00:00:50,520
You didn’t notice anything strange about Sister Meng

15
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:55,230
I'm not familiar with that woman. Who is that woman?
